{"id": "boundary-v1-h264-01", "codecs": ["h264"], "topic": "SPS 裁剪单位", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "avc-sps-cropping-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "H.264 的 SPS 使用 4:2:0（ChromaArrayType=1，SubWidthC=2，SubHeightC=2），frame_mbs_only_flag=1。未裁剪亮度尺寸是 1920×1088，frame_cropping_flag=1，只有底部偏移为 4，其余偏移为 0。求输出宽、高和最后一行亮度样本的零起始坐标。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 width、height、last_y。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "垂直裁剪单位是 2×(2−1)=2，底部移除 8 行。宽仍为 1920，高为 1080；最后一行坐标为 1088−8−1=1079。\n{\"width\":1920,\"height\":1080,\"last_y\":1079}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h264-spec", "source_revision": "028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 106}, "snippet_sha256": "3a413b368a2ca2e1a627746ce52818245b124568fe1222e5f7c21d4d05ab5131"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h264-02", "codecs": ["h264"], "topic": "SPS 裁剪单位", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "avc-sps-cropping-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "H.264 的 SPS 使用 4:2:0（SubWidthC=2，SubHeightC=2），frame_mbs_only_flag=0。未裁剪亮度帧为 720×576，裁剪开启，左、右、上、下偏移分别是 2、1、1、2。求输出宽、高及裁剪区的最小与最大亮度坐标（含两端）。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 width、height、first_x、last_x、first_y、last_y。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "水平方向单位 2，垂直方向单位 2×(2−0)=4。横向从 4 到 720−2−1=717，纵向从 4 到 576−8−1=567，所以尺寸是 714×564。\n{\"width\":714,\"height\":564,\"first_x\":4,\"last_x\":717,\"first_y\":4,\"last_y\":567}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h264-spec", "source_revision": "028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 106}, "snippet_sha256": "3a413b368a2ca2e1a627746ce52818245b124568fe1222e5f7c21d4d05ab5131"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h264-03", "codecs": ["h264"], "topic": "SPS 裁剪单位", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "avc-sps-cropping-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "H.264 中 ChromaArrayType=0、frame_mbs_only_flag=0，未裁剪亮度帧是 128×64。A 的 frame_cropping_flag=0；B 开启裁剪，左、右、上、下偏移为 1、3、2、1。比较两种情况下的输出亮度尺寸。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 a_width、a_height、b_width、b_height。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "A 中未发送偏移，四个值都推断为 0，保留 128×64。B 用水平单位 1、垂直单位 2，宽减少 4，高减少 6，得到 124×58。\n{\"a_width\":128,\"a_height\":64,\"b_width\":124,\"b_height\":58}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h264-spec", "source_revision": "028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 106}, "snippet_sha256": "3a413b368a2ca2e1a627746ce52818245b124568fe1222e5f7c21d4d05ab5131"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h265-01", "codecs": ["h265"], "topic": "PCM 亮度样本重建", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "hevc-pcm-reconstruction-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "HEVC 当前编码单元的 pcm_flag=1，BitDepthY=10，SPS 的 pcm_sample_bit_depth_luma_minus1=7。一个解出的亮度 PCM 样本是 255。求该样本的 PCM 位深、写入重建亮度前的左移位数以及重建值。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 pcm_depth、shift、sample。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "PCM 位深是 7+1=8；重建位深高两位，按该分支左移 2 位，所以 255 变为 1020。这里是位移，不是把 255 映射成 1023。\n{\"pcm_depth\":8,\"shift\":2,\"sample\":1020}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h265-spec", "source_revision": "78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 97}, "snippet_sha256": "6614cee27e0eb154e60be9a7d0607117ea37f46aaec6dc31d56147b814c4850e"}, {"source_id": "h265-spec", "source_revision": "78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 144}, "snippet_sha256": "3a182b7286ca3258470a472367d7dea83f2eb9d9f7ee855cfeeff7e7b0e3bb7e"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h265-02", "codecs": ["h265"], "topic": "PCM 亮度样本重建", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "hevc-pcm-reconstruction-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "HEVC 当前块已经走亮度 PCM 重建，BitDepthY=10，pcm_sample_bit_depth_luma_minus1=9。两个合法 PCM 样本依次为 511、1023。求左移量和两个重建亮度样本。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 shift、first、second。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "PCM 位深和重建位深都是 10，差为 0。左移 0 位，两个值均保持不变。\n{\"shift\":0,\"first\":511,\"second\":1023}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h265-spec", "source_revision": "78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 97}, "snippet_sha256": "6614cee27e0eb154e60be9a7d0607117ea37f46aaec6dc31d56147b814c4850e"}, {"source_id": "h265-spec", "source_revision": "78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 144}, "snippet_sha256": "3a182b7286ca3258470a472367d7dea83f2eb9d9f7ee855cfeeff7e7b0e3bb7e"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h265-03", "codecs": ["h265"], "topic": "PCM 亮度样本重建", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "hevc-pcm-reconstruction-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "HEVC 序列启用了 PCM，BitDepthY=10。审查 SPS 的两个候选值：A 的 pcm_sample_bit_depth_luma_minus1=9，B 为 10。仅就 PCM 亮度位深不得大于 BitDepthY 的约束，分别求 PCM 位深和是否通过（1=通过，0=不通过）。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 a_depth、a_pass、b_depth、b_pass。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "A 的 PCM 位深为 10，等于上限，符合该约束。B 为 11，超出重建位深，不符合；不能把负移位当作该分支的重建规则。\n{\"a_depth\":10,\"a_pass\":1,\"b_depth\":11,\"b_pass\":0}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h265-spec", "source_revision": "78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 97}, "snippet_sha256": "6614cee27e0eb154e60be9a7d0607117ea37f46aaec6dc31d56147b814c4850e"}, {"source_id": "h265-spec", "source_revision": "78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 144}, "snippet_sha256": "3a182b7286ca3258470a472367d7dea83f2eb9d9f7ee855cfeeff7e7b0e3bb7e"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h266-01", "codecs": ["h266"], "topic": "活跃参考索引数量", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "vvc-rpl-active-count-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "H.266 B slice 的 RPL0、RPL1 分别有 2、4 个条目，PPS 对应的 pps_num_ref_idx_default_active_minus1 为 4、1，slice 显式给出 sh_num_ref_idx_active_override_flag=0。其余条件满足。求两表的 NumRefIdxActive。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 l0、l1。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "未覆盖 PPS 默认值时，对每个使用的表，将默认值加 1 后与实际条目数取较小值。RPL0 为 min(5,2)=2，RPL1 为 min(2,4)=2。\n{\"l0\":2,\"l1\":2}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 76}, "snippet_sha256": "289e0145a07d04dd44e9d36039e8dc6732afe8ddd43dcfd160a3d169c93912b6"}, {"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 171}, "snippet_sha256": "c3ac01c2cd1c0d9316a0b5ae19a45e9d562df7c8187848262e566d053655c73a"}, {"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 172}, "snippet_sha256": "0b74688f9ef5993a78a1dda500b7a6dc0657b85979ee7fa81c534b5d3d5b1756"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h266-02", "codecs": ["h266"], "topic": "活跃参考索引数量", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "vvc-rpl-active-count-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "H.266 P slice 的 RPL0 只有 1 个条目，RPL1 即便存在也不由此 slice 使用。按 slice header 的读取条件，求 sh_num_ref_idx_active_override_flag 的推断值以及 RPL0、RPL1 的 NumRefIdxActive。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 override、l0、l1。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "P slice 只按 RPL0 的条目数决定是否读覆盖标志。这里只有 1 项，不读取覆盖标志，推断为 1。RPL0 的 active-minus-one 也缺省推断为 0，因此活跃项数为 1；P slice 的 RPL1 活跃项数为 0。\n{\"override\":1,\"l0\":1,\"l1\":0}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 76}, "snippet_sha256": "289e0145a07d04dd44e9d36039e8dc6732afe8ddd43dcfd160a3d169c93912b6"}, {"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 171}, "snippet_sha256": "c3ac01c2cd1c0d9316a0b5ae19a45e9d562df7c8187848262e566d053655c73a"}, {"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 172}, "snippet_sha256": "0b74688f9ef5993a78a1dda500b7a6dc0657b85979ee7fa81c534b5d3d5b1756"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-h266-03", "codecs": ["h266"], "topic": "活跃参考索引数量", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "vvc-rpl-active-count-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "H.266 B slice 的 RPL0 有 1 项，RPL1 有 4 项。覆盖标志显式等于 1，RPL1 读到 sh_num_ref_idx_active_minus1[1]=2。求 RPL0 的对应字段是否显式出现（1=出现，0=未出现）及两表的活跃项数。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 l0_field_present、l0、l1。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "覆盖已启用，但逐表字段只在该表有多于一项时读取。RPL0 字段不出现并推断为 0，故活跃项数为 1；RPL1 由 2+1 得 3。\n{\"l0_field_present\":0,\"l0\":1,\"l1\":3}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 76}, "snippet_sha256": "289e0145a07d04dd44e9d36039e8dc6732afe8ddd43dcfd160a3d169c93912b6"}, {"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 171}, "snippet_sha256": "c3ac01c2cd1c0d9316a0b5ae19a45e9d562df7c8187848262e566d053655c73a"}, {"source_id": "h266-spec", "source_revision": "ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 172}, "snippet_sha256": "0b74688f9ef5993a78a1dda500b7a6dc0657b85979ee7fa81c534b5d3d5b1756"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
{"id": "boundary-v1-av1-01", "codecs": ["av1"], "topic": "有符号 order hint 距离", "task_type": "calculation", "split_group": "av1-signed-order-hint-distance-family", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "AV1 已启用 order hint，OrderHintBits=3。计算 get_relative_dist(1, 7)，并说明为何结果不是普通相减所得的 −6。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 distance。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "3 bit 周期为 8。普通差 −6 在模 8 下对应 2，且 2 位于 3 bit 有符号区间 [−4,3]，所以返回 2。\n{\"distance\":2}"}], "evidence": [{"source_id": "av1-spec-pdf", "source_revision": "ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 43}, "snippet_sha256": "f77c4d6087aef2960c4242bcc5983c5f9fcfc764507f78f491215853974627f0"}, {"source_id": "av1-spec-pdf", "source_revision": "ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9", "locator": {"type": "pdf_page", "page": 55}, "snippet_sha256": "c814a911dde05718d7df2128ecd20555a610bb9b814d3c8547fe60be3e94e4d9"}], "generation": {"model": "Codex gpt-6.1-sol", "revision": "unknown", "prompt_version": "boundary-v1-original", "created_at": "2026-11-11"}, "verification": {"status": "pending", "checks": [], "reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": null}, "eligibility": {"status": "pending", "note": "自写数值题和推导；来源与复算见本批记录，待单独复核后才能进入训练。"}}
